# data-flow-enrichment

## Core Enrichment Pipeline
Location: server/src/lib/enrichment/providers/
Importance Score: 90

Primary data enrichment workflow for defendant verification:
- Multi-step enrichment process through Pipl and Whitepages integrations
- Custom defendant profile aggregation from multiple data sources
- Progressive confidence scoring based on data match quality
- Related party discovery with relationship validation
- Specialized contact verification for bail bonds requirements

## Case Data Enhancement 
Location: src/hooks/enrichment.js
Importance Score: 85

Case enrichment workflow:
- Automated bond amount classification and standardization
- Defendant history aggregation across multiple counties
- Court record correlation and validation
- Document verification states: pending, verified, rejected
- Custom data normalization for different county formats

## Verification States
Location: server/src/lib/enrichment/states.js
Importance Score: 75

Enrichment status tracking system:
- PENDING_VERIFICATION
- VERIFIED
- REJECTED
- NEEDS_REVIEW
- EXPIRED
- BLACKLISTED

Each state includes:
- Required documentation types
- Verification timeout periods
- County-specific override rules
- Automatic progression conditions

## Data Provider Integration
Location: server/src/lib/enrichment/providers/
Importance Score: 80

Provider-specific implementations:
- Pipl identity verification
- Whitepages contact validation
- US Census address standardization
- County court record integration
- Custom field mapping for each provider
- Fallback provider chain configuration

